local sbd=bb.valid(rbd,ebd)
local tbd=sbd and(U.flat(sbd)-fbd.p).Magnitude
if tbd and tbd<=gbd and(not pbd or tbd<pbd)then
obd,pbd=sbd,tbd
end
end
return obd,obd and bb.cover(obd,(tonumber(ebd.range)or 0))or 0
end
local ubd=bb.grifS
